      "heading": "What Quickler is not",
      "html": "<p>Quickler is not a substitute for your judgement or for regulated methods. A fire risk assessment still needs a competent assessor working to the Fire Safety Order and, where right, PAS 79. A RICS survey still needs a RICS member and the right standard. You still read and sign the report. This is reporting software, not legal or professional advice.</p><p>What it gives you is a record with photos and times, made on site, not from memory. <a href=\"/pages/help/index.html#contact-form-section\">Ask us</a> if a format affects your firm.</p>"
