      "heading": "Questions, answered",
      "html": "<h3>What is insurance survey software?</h3><p>A tool for recording and reporting a survey of an insured risk. That can be a risk survey for underwriting, a loss adjuster's site report, or a property or fire risk survey. It holds your findings, photos and recommendations and makes the report. Quickler does this in WhatsApp.</p><h3>Do I need to install a new app?</h3><p>No. Each question arrives in your WhatsApp chat. You reply by text, voice note or photo. Nothing to download. No login.</p><h3>Does the software make the survey valid?</h3><p>No. You do, with your competence and the right standard, such as RICS standards or PAS 79 for fire risk. Software helps you finish the report on site and send it fast.</p><h3>How much does it cost a survey firm?</h3><p>£75 per month per phone number & unlimited free dashboard accounts. Everyone else is free, including office staff who only read reports. Start with a 14-day free trial. Everything is unlocked and you need no card to start. Paid accounts have no limits.</p><h3>Which survey types does it cover?</h3><p>Risk surveys, loss adjuster site reports, property risk and fire risk surveys, and more. Send your own report and every new one comes back in that layout.</p><h3>Related guides</h3><ul><li><a href=\"/pages/insurance-risk-survey-report-uk.html\">Commercial insurance risk survey reports</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/loss-adjuster-site-report-app-uk.html\">Loss adjuster site report app</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/property-risk-assessment-insurance-uk.html\">Property risk assessment for insurers</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/fire-risk-assessment-insurance-uk.html\">Fire risk assessment survey app</a></li></ul>"
